{
  "name": "Turn identified website visitor companies into campaign contacts",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Turn identified website visitor companies into campaign contacts\n\n### How it works\nReach the companies that just looked at your pricing page. Your website visitor tool posts JSON with company_domain and page to the webhook. Companies already handled in an earlier run are skipped, so nothing is paid twice. For a new company, Argorant searches the people with the job titles in Settings (for example the buyer and their boss) and adds up to people_per_company of them to your campaign; only valid emails join.\n\nCosts: 1 credit per new person added. Previews are free.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Edit **Settings**: titles and people_per_company.\n4. Pick the campaign in **Add the buyers to the campaign**.\n5. Send POST requests with {\"company_domain\": \"linfield.example\", \"page\": \"/pricing\"} to the production URL of **Visitor identified**.\n\n### Customization\nOnly react to some pages by adding a filter on page, or post the company to your team chat first.",
        "height": 592,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "2434b3da-45d7-4e69-a29f-ada60971f381",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Once per company\nEach domain is handled one time across runs, so you never pay twice.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "6e91fd4a-d1d0-4a48-886b-ec4c7899e530",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
